  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.4 - Fix: markup containing head-only elements (<style>, <script>, <link>, <meta>, <title>) is now parsed through a <template> instead of a text/html document, so those elements render in source order instead of being hoisted into <head> and dropped. Requires SpawnDev.SpawnJS 2.0.12+ (HTMLTemplateElement, Element.SetInnerHTML(TrustedHTML)).",
